#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
08.1_Creator_Channel_Harvester_Upload.py (Streaming-Version inkl. Anti-Ban & Smart-Router)
- Liest die geprüfte 'QA_Video_Discovery.xlsx' (aus 08.0, 08.1 oder 08.2).
